<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents an Object Map.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLRefObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RefObjectMap" .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b13 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:PredicateObjectMap must be an IRI or blank node.\n        " .
_:n86ea83d6357041b3b98e0ac866f0da00b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:parentTriplesMap may only be provided once and must be an IRI\n        or Blank Node referring to a Triples Map.\n        " .
