_:n2108547d52574999bf8c1c628667deedb5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:predicateMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> _:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b25 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n72cd13b3f6cf4b7a8c20e19891c0e418b26 .
_:n2108547d52574999bf8c1c628667deedb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n2108547d52574999bf8c1c628667deedb4 .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b18 .
_:n3b811757bd534a25afbc99aefc88a9deb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be either rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, rml:UnsafeURI, rml:Literal, or rml:BlankNode for a Term Map.\n        May only be provided once.\n        " .
_:n6e4bbed1dbc245d9a15dde13ce3a93d9b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LogicalViewJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n6591fd558470403d983824c650019933b3 .
_:n3e5ff10315ca4d399d3228b4ebbe9932b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:targetFields property must be specified for each rml:InclusionAnnotation.\r\n        " .
_:n6e4bbed1dbc245d9a15dde13ce3a93d9b4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#zeroOrMorePath> _:n6e4bbed1dbc245d9a15dde13ce3a93d9b5 .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b23 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:Nd40618a039ab4e03a1160492e74b15ea .
_:nd271b2be618342ad82d1e2c2515ae929b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/datatypeMap> .
_:n6591fd558470403d983824c650019933b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
