_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b32 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/objectMap> .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/childMap> .
_:n72cd13b3f6cf4b7a8c20e19891c0e418b26 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Two distinct fields in this view's effective field set (its own fields plus any introduced by leftJoin/innerJoin) share the same rml:fieldName." .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Predicate Map.\n    " .
_:n3b811757bd534a25afbc99aefc88a9deb18 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/termType> .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either a rml:subject, rml:subjectMap is required, not multiple.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Expression Map must have one of rml:template, rml:constant, or\n    rml:reference, unless rml:termType is rml:BlankNode with no expression.\n    " .
_:na07168091793425e91689eaf5256a943b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:class must be an IRI and may be specified multiple times.\n        " .
_:n3e5ff10315ca4d399d3228b4ebbe9932b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        property targetFields specifies the Fields target of the InclusionAnnotation.\r\n        " .
_:n6e4bbed1dbc245d9a15dde13ce3a93d9b10 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/IterableFieldShape> .
