_:nbb965180f5da4d1cab3d466668f5a5ebb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is\n            allowed.\n        " .
_:n6591fd558470403d983824c650019933b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        At least one rml:field property must be specified for a rml:LogicalViewJoin, with a leaf expression field as its value.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LeafExpressionFieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:ExpressionField description.\r\n    " .
_:n3b811757bd534a25afbc99aefc88a9deb14 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n3b811757bd534a25afbc99aefc88a9deb15 .
_:n8017ce8428d046d194c7df52c72a0475b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A template (format string) to specify how to generate a value for a \n        subject, predicate, or object, using one or more columns from a logical\n        table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b33 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b29 .
_:n6591fd558470403d983824c650019933b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        A field of the logical view join.\r\n        " .
_:n2108547d52574999bf8c1c628667deedb6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .
_:n72cd13b3f6cf4b7a8c20e19891c0e418b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        A structural annotation of the logical view.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Node must have a valid rml:LogicalView description.\n    rml:LogicalView requires\n    - exactly one rml:viewOn property, with a rml:AbstractLogicalSource as its value.\n    - at least one rml:field property, with a rml:Field as its value.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StructuralAnnotation" .
_:nfea00366b75b487f9c117855869c0d50b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/onFields> .
_:n3b811757bd534a25afbc99aefc88a9deb15 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n282791abb5e24d4c83f2f6e7a87242d5b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/logicalSource> .
_:n7193b1eca9af46329cd7367142624707b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/childMap> .
_:n7193b1eca9af46329cd7367142624707b12 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:GraphMap must specify an rml:template, rml:reference or rml:constant\n    with the IRI of the Named Graph.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:nd271b2be618342ad82d1e2c2515ae929b8 .
