<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n2108547d52574999bf8c1c628667deedb6 .
_:n2108547d52574999bf8c1c628667deedb11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:objectMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
